DETECTORS: AtomicWriteGrainTests.ExecuteAsync_routes_execute_phase_writes_through_the_prepared_path
SUMMARY: the execute phase writes outside the prepared scope, so nothing is staged as a hidden pending bucket

--- FIND
        using (LatticePreparedContext.BeginScope())
        {
            var bindingMoves = 0;
--- REPLACE
        using ((IDisposable?)null)
        {
            var bindingMoves = 0;
